{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Call of Duty\u00ae: Warzone\u2122, the massive free-to-play combat arena. Experience thrilling modes &amp; new gameplay features in Verdansk and Rebirth Island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haven's Hollow Debuts in Call of Duty\u00ae: Warzone\u2122.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something strange is afoot in Haven\u2019s Hollow. The all-new Resurgence Map makes its debut in Season 01, dropping players into an isolated Appalachian town that feels like a living relic of old school American charm. Though the picturesque town may be shrouded in mystery, it\u2019s also the stage for fast-paced, frenetic action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can also drop into Verdansk and fight through new and reimagined POIs. And before long, it\u2019ll be time to bundle up for winter with the return of CODMAS. Drop in, lock on, and eliminate anything in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot For Rewards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover supply boxes and complete contracts to build your arsenal and gain a tactical advantage.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1962663?t=1767376006","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962663/0fc41bf8af50953c5d3784fb4acbe5c65acc0f83/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767376006","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962663/84a5d6150e49013a9b30c62d87cb5df602e2ef26/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767376006","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962663/84a5d6150e49013a9b30c62d87cb5df602e2ef26/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767376006","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":